# Data Catalog Astro UI Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Replace the mock data catalog UI with real dbt artifact data from R2, add model list/detail pages, glossary via Content Collections, and AI Search integration.

**Architecture:** Astro 6 hybrid rendering on Workers Static Assets. SSR pages read dbt artifacts from R2 `dbt-artifacts-modeling` at request time via Cloudflare bindings. Content Collections provide build-time glossary from MDX files in Git. AI Search (AutoRAG) powers natural language search via `env.AI.autorag()`.

**Tech Stack:** Astro 6, React 19, @cloudflare/kumo, Tailwind CSS v4, @astrojs/cloudflare, TypeScript, Vitest

**Scope Note:** This plan covers the `data-catalog-app/` directory only. The `catalog-generator` Worker (Markdown generation for AI Search indexing), R2 Event Notifications, and Workers Deploy Hook CI/CD are separate plans.

