You are implementing Task 6 + Task 7: Content Collections for Glossary + Glossary Pages

## Task 6: Content Collections Setup

### Files to create/modify:

**Install @astrojs/mdx:**
```bash
cd data-catalog-app && pnpm add @astrojs/mdx
```

**Modify `data-catalog-app/astro.config.mjs`** — add mdx integration:
```javascript
import { defineConfig } from 'astro/config';
import cloudflare from '@astrojs/cloudflare';
import react from '@astrojs/react';
import mdx from '@astrojs/mdx';
import tailwindcss from '@tailwindcss/vite';

export default defineConfig({
  adapter: cloudflare(),
  integrations: [react(), mdx()],
  vite: {
    plugins: [tailwindcss()],
  },
});
```

**Create `data-catalog-app/src/content.config.ts`:**
```typescript
import { defineCollection, z } from "astro:content";
import { glob } from "astro/loaders";

const glossary = defineCollection({
  loader: glob({ pattern: "**/*.mdx", base: "./src/content/glossary" }),
  schema: z.object({
    term: z.string(),
    termEn: z.string(),
    category: z.enum(["財務", "プロダクト", "マーケティング", "エンジニアリング", "データ"]),
    relatedModels: z.array(z.string()).default([]),
    relatedMetrics: z.array(z.string()).default([]),
    owner: z.string().optional(),
    lastReviewed: z.coerce.date().optional(),
  }),
});

export const collections = { glossary };
```

**Create `data-catalog-app/src/content/glossary/revenue.mdx`:**
```mdx
---
term: 売上
termEn: Revenue
category: 財務
relatedModels:
  - fct_visits
  - dim_patient
owner: data-team
lastReviewed: 2026-04-01
---

## 定義

売上とは、患者の診察・処方から発生する医療収入の総額を指す。

## 計算ロジック

- `fct_visits` テーブルの各訪問レコードに紐づく診察料を集計
- 保険適用分と自己負担分を含む

## 注意点

- 返金・キャンセル分は含まない
- 月次集計時は診察日ベース（請求日ベースではない）
```

## Task 7: Glossary Pages

### Files to create:

**`data-catalog-app/src/pages/glossary/index.astro`** — SSG glossary list:
```astro
---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { AppSidebar } from "../../components/AppSidebar";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const entries = await getCollection("glossary");
const byCategory = entries.reduce(
  (acc, entry) => {
    const cat = entry.data.category;
    if (!acc[cat]) acc[cat] = [];
    acc[cat].push(entry);
    return acc;
  },
  {} as Record<string, typeof entries>
);
---

<Layout title="用語集 — Data Catalog">
  <div class="flex min-h-screen">
    <AppSidebar client:load />
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6 p-6">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">用語集</h1>
        <p class="text-kumo-subtle text-sm">
          {entries.length} terms defined
        </p>
      </div>

      {Object.entries(byCategory).map(([category, items]) => (
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">{category}</h2>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            {items.map((entry) => (
              <a
                href={`/glossary/${entry.id}`}
                class="block rounded-lg border border-kumo-border p-4 hover:bg-kumo-subtle transition-colors"
              >
                <span class="font-medium">{entry.data.term}</span>
                <span class="text-kumo-subtle text-sm ml-2">({entry.data.termEn})</span>
                {entry.data.relatedModels.length > 0 && (
                  <span class="text-kumo-subtle text-xs ml-2">
                    — {entry.data.relatedModels.join(", ")}
                  </span>
                )}
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
```

**`data-catalog-app/src/pages/glossary/[slug].astro`** — SSG glossary detail:

This page uses `getStaticPaths` since it's prerendered. It renders the MDX content and shows metadata.

```astro
---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { AppSidebar } from "../../components/AppSidebar";
import { getCollection, render } from "astro:content";

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const entries = await getCollection("glossary");
  return entries.map((entry) => ({
    params: { slug: entry.id },
    props: { entry },
  }));
}

const { entry } = Astro.props;
const { Content } = await render(entry);
---

